    (SYNONYM DROPLETS DROPS) (ADJECTIVE CLEAR)
    (FLAGS NDESCBIT) (INTERACTIONS "")
    (TEXT "Shift your head a little. A cheek breaks up into separate beads and then comes together again when you lean back.")>

